id: SAVE16-4
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: history_load_session
target: crates/core/src/history_load.rs
find:         other => Err(other.verdict()),
replace:         Opened::ViewOnly { .. } => Ok(LoadedSession { session: Session::from_state(ir, SessionState::default()), notes: None }), other => Err(other.verdict()),
expect-fail: view_only_yields_no_session
note: 表示だけの履歴でも実行環境を作る（開かないはずの履歴で続きを操作できてしまう）
